	text: [
		"By default, the §6bound blade§r and §6tools§r are inactive and not very effective. ",
		"",
		"To §6activate§r the blade and tools, §6sneak right-click§r while holding it. ",
		"",
		"When §6active§r, the damage and effectiveness is §6increased§r, but will §6consume life essence§r from your soul network over time.",
		"",
		"Killing a mob with the §6Bound Blade§r, it has a chance to drop a §6Blood Shard§r.",
		"",
		"The §6tools§r have something called \"§6Beast Mode§r\". ",
		"Holding down §6right-click§r while they are active will §6charge§r them up. ",
		"§6Releasing§r once charged up will mine up to a §65x5x5§r area, at the cost of §610k life essence§r.",
